---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Cennik – FIZJOMAT Gliwice"
  description="Cennik usług fizjoterapeutycznych FIZJOMAT Gliwice. Konsultacja od 180 zł, analiza biegu 300 zł, pakiety rehabilitacyjne i treningowe."
>
  <article class="cennik-page">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Nawigacja okruszkowa">
        <a href="/">Strona główna</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">›</span>
        <span>Cennik</span>
      </nav>

      <h1>Cennik</h1>
      <p class="cennik-lead">Ceny obowiązujące w FIZJOMAT. Wizyty niestandardowe wyceniane są indywidualnie. Nie współpracujemy z NFZ — wyłącznie wizyty komercyjne.</p>

      <div class="cennik-grid">

        <!-- WIZYTY POJEDYNCZE -->
        <section class="price-section">
          <h2>Wizyty</h2>
          <ul class="price-list">
            <li>
              <span class="price-name">Konsultacja fizjoterapeutyczna <em>1 h</em></span>
              <span class="price-value">190 zł</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="price-name">Wizyta rehabilitacyjna <em>do 55 min</em></span>
              <span class="price-value">180 zł</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="price-name">Trening medyczny <em>1 na 1</em></span>
              <span class="price-value">170 zł</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="price-name">Trening medyczny <em>2 osoby</em></span>
              <span class="price-value">200 zł</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="price-name">Analiza biegu</span>
              <span class="price-value">300 zł</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="price-name">Masaż pneumatyczny Normatec <em>45 min</em></span>
              <span class="price-value">90 zł</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="price-name">Kinesiotaping <em>w wizycie bezpłatny</em></span>
              <span class="price-value">50 zł</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="price-note">* Cena każdej wizyty niestandardowej ustalana jest indywidualnie z pacjentem.</p>
          <p class="price-note">** Zajęcia prowadzone jeden na jeden z fizjoterapeutą/trenerem.</p>
        </section>

        <!-- PAKIETY -->
        <section class="price-section">
          <h2>Pakiety</h2>

          <h3>Rehabilitacja</h3>
          <ul class="price-list">
            <li>
              <span class="price-name">10 wizyt rehabilitacyjnych</span>
              <span class="price-value">1650 zł</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="price-name">5 wizyt rehabilitacyjnych</span>
              <span class="price-value">850 zł</span>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h3>Trening medyczny <span class="pkg-sub">1 na 1</span></h3>
          <ul class="price-list">
            <li>
              <span class="price-name">10 sesji treningowych</span>
              <span class="price-value">1400 zł</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="price-name">5 sesji treningowych</span>
              <span class="price-value">750 zł</span>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h3>Trening medyczny <span class="pkg-sub">2 na 1</span></h3>
          <ul class="price-list">
            <li>
              <span class="price-name">10 sesji treningowych</span>
              <span class="price-value">1600 zł</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="price-name">5 sesji treningowych</span>
              <span class="price-value">1800 zł</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

      </div>

      <div class="cennik-cta">
        <a href="/#kontakt" class="btn btn-primary">Umów wizytę</a>
        <a href="/cennik.pdf" class="btn btn-outline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Pobierz PDF</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .cennik-page { padding: var(--section-padding); }

  .breadcrumb {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .breadcrumb a { color: var(--color-text-muted); }
  .breadcrumb a:hover { color: var(--color-primary); }

  h1 { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .cennik-lead { color: var(--color-text-muted); max-width: 65ch; margin-bottom: 3rem; }

  .cennik-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .cennik-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .price-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-primary);
  }
  .price-section h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem;
  }
  .pkg-sub {
    font-weight: 400;
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .price-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }
  .price-list li {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .price-list li:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }

  .price-name {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .price-name em {
    display: block;
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-top: 0.1rem;
  }
  .price-value {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .price-note {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-top: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .cennik-cta {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
</style>
